<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xmile version="1.0" xmlns="http://docs.oasis-open.org/xmile/ns/XMILE/v1.0"><header><vendor>cloud-itonami</vendor><product version="1">hikobae</product><name>令和8年熊本地震 復旧ダイナミクス</name></header><sim_specs method="euler" time_units="days"><start>0.0</start><stop>365.0</stop><dt>0.25</dt></sim_specs><model name="post_earthquake_recovery"><sim_specs method="euler" time_units="days"><start>0.0</start><stop>365.0</stop><dt>0.25</dt></sim_specs><variables><aux name="water_service_capacity"><eqn>1550.0 + 4916.666666666667 * SMTH1(STEP(1, 14.0), 3.0, 0)</eqn><units>households/day</units><doc>戸別作業の日次能力。増強分は井戸水対応チーム設置(day 14)後に遅れて立ち上がる。</doc></aux><flow name="temp_completion_rate"><eqn>DELAY3(temp_start_rate, 60.0, 0)</eqn><units>units/day</units><non_negative/></flow><stock name="displaced_outside"><eqn>3000.0</eqn><units>persons</units><non_negative/><outflow>outside_return_home</outflow></stock><aux name="certificate_coverage"><eqn>MIN(1, certificates_issued / 24215.0)</eqn><units>dimensionless</units><doc>被害住家のうち罹災証明が出た割合。下流の全工程がこれに掛かる。</doc></aux><stock name="temp_units_pipeline"><eqn>0</eqn><units>units</units><non_negative/><inflow>temp_start_rate</inflow><outflow>temp_completion_rate</outflow></stock><flow name="assessment_rate"><eqn>MIN(assessment_queue / DT, assessment_capacity)</eqn><units>buildings/day</units><non_negative/></flow><aux name="certificate_delay"><eqn>IF TIME &gt;= 1.0E9 THEN 3.0 ELSE 14.0</eqn><units>days</units><doc>調査完了から交付までの事務処理日数。オンライン申請導入で短縮する。</doc></aux><flow name="temp_start_rate"><eqn>11.736842105263158 * certificate_coverage</eqn><units>units/day</units><non_negative/></flow><stock name="temp_units_available"><eqn>0</eqn><units>units</units><non_negative/><inflow>temp_completion_rate</inflow><outflow>temp_occupancy_rate</outflow></stock><aux name="environment_risk_multiplier"><eqn>1 + (2.5 - 1) * (1 - 0.0)</eqn><units>dimensionless</units><doc>猛暑・寒冷等の環境荷重。エアコン/段ボールベッド/パーティションが行き渡ると下がる。</doc></aux><aux name="assessment_capacity"><eqn>40.0 * 12.0</eqn><units>buildings/day</units></aux><flow name="shelter_to_temp"><eqn>MIN(shelter_longterm / DT, temp_units_available * 2.3 / DT)</eqn><units>persons/day</units><non_negative/></flow><stock name="households_without_power"><eqn>48530.0</eqn><units>households</units><non_negative/><outflow>power_restoration</outflow></stock><flow name="water_network_restoration"><eqn>MIN(water_out_network / DT, 4150.0)</eqn><units>households/day</units><non_negative/></flow><stock name="cumulative_indirect_deaths"><eqn>0</eqn><units>persons</units><non_negative/><inflow>indirect_death_rate</inflow></stock><flow name="power_restoration"><eqn>MIN(households_without_power / DT, 7000.0)</eqn><units>households/day</units><non_negative/></flow><flow name="outside_return_home"><eqn>displaced_outside * 0.15999999999999998 * lifeline_availability</eqn><units>persons/day</units><non_negative/></flow><flow name="indirect_death_rate"><eqn>(shelter_returnable + shelter_longterm) * 4.0E-6 * environment_risk_multiplier + displaced_outside * 4.0E-6 * environment_risk_multiplier * 1.5</eqn><units>persons/day</units><doc>避難所外は保健の巡回が届きにくいぶん係数を重くしている(1.5)。この 1.5 自体に出典は無い。</doc><non_negative/></flow><aux name="shelter_population"><eqn>shelter_returnable + shelter_longterm</eqn><units>persons</units><doc>内閣府が日次で公表している『避難者数』に対応する量。校正の突合先。</doc></aux><aux name="displaced_population"><eqn>shelter_returnable + shelter_longterm + displaced_outside</eqn><units>persons</units></aux><flow name="certificate_rate"><eqn>DELAY1(assessment_rate, certificate_delay, 0)</eqn><units>buildings/day</units><non_negative/></flow><flow name="shelter_return_home"><eqn>shelter_returnable * 0.15999999999999998 * lifeline_availability</eqn><units>persons/day</units><non_negative/></flow><flow name="water_service_restoration"><eqn>MIN(water_out_service / DT, water_service_capacity)</eqn><units>households/day</units><non_negative/></flow><stock name="shelter_returnable"><eqn>9931.0 * (1 - 0.2988957137582654)</eqn><units>persons</units><non_negative/><outflow>shelter_return_home</outflow></stock><flow name="temp_occupancy_rate"><eqn>shelter_to_temp / 2.3</eqn><units>units/day</units><non_negative/></flow><stock name="assessment_queue"><eqn>24215.0</eqn><units>buildings</units><non_negative/><outflow>assessment_rate</outflow></stock><aux name="households_without_water"><eqn>water_out_network + water_out_service</eqn><units>households</units><doc>国土交通省が日次で公表する『断水中』に対応する量。校正の突合先。</doc></aux><stock name="certificates_issued"><eqn>0</eqn><units>buildings</units><non_negative/><inflow>certificate_rate</inflow></stock><stock name="cumulative_person_days_displaced"><eqn>0</eqn><units>person-days</units><non_negative/><inflow>displacement_accrual</inflow></stock><stock name="water_out_service"><eqn>108100.0 * (1 - 0.49907493061979646)</eqn><units>households</units><non_negative/><outflow>water_service_restoration</outflow></stock><stock name="shelter_longterm"><eqn>9931.0 * 0.2988957137582654</eqn><units>persons</units><non_negative/><outflow>shelter_to_temp</outflow></stock><aux name="lifeline_availability"><eqn>1 - 0.5 * households_without_water / 108100.0 - 0.5 * households_without_power / 48530.0</eqn><units>dimensionless</units></aux><stock name="in_temporary_housing"><eqn>0</eqn><units>persons</units><non_negative/><inflow>shelter_to_temp</inflow></stock><stock name="water_out_network"><eqn>108100.0 * 0.49907493061979646</eqn><units>households</units><non_negative/><outflow>water_network_restoration</outflow></stock><flow name="displacement_accrual"><eqn>displaced_population</eqn><units>person-days/day</units><non_negative/></flow></variables></model></xmile>